message.content:
Mobility scooters for disabled persons are classified in heading 8713 (carriages for disabled persons, whether or not motorized or otherwise mechanically propelled). Subheading 8713.90 covers other types, i.e., motorized. 8713.10 is "not mechanically propelled" and 8713.90 is "other". The statistical suffix is 8713.90.0000 (the 10-digit form is 8713.90.0000).

CBP rulings on mobility scooters, for example 3-wheel and 4-wheel power scooters, classify them in 8713.90.1000, which covers "Other: Motorized wheelchairs" or similar. The actual HTS structure is 8713.90.10 (Other, with 8713.90.1000), and I believe the whole subheading breaks down as 8713.90.10 Other. In this case, I'll go with 8713.90.1000.

{"hts_code": "8713.90.1000", "reason": "A battery-powered four-wheeled mobility scooter designed for persons with limited mobility is a motorized carriage for disabled persons, classified in heading 8713, subheading 8713.90 (other than not mechanically propelled)."}
